# Agreement Duration and Termination

This scope calculates the initial expiry date and the deadline for requesting termination or renegotiation of the agreement.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementDuration:
  input entry_date content date
  input initial_term content duration
  input notice_period content duration
  output initial_expiry_date content date
  output termination_deadline content date
```

## Initial Expiry Date

The agreement remains in force for an initial period of 10 years from the date it enters into force.

```catala
scope AgreementDuration:
  date round down
  definition initial_expiry_date equals entry_date + initial_term
  definition termination_deadline equals initial_expiry_date - notice_period
```

## Termination Deadline

The agreement must be terminated or renegotiated not later than six months prior to the expiry date.